Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">华为云码道全面升级：发布全球首个鸿蒙专属AI编码智能体</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">SpaceXAI发布Grok 4.7模型：推理速度翻倍且价格降至每百万Token输入2美元</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI成立数学与AI顾问组，神秘模型24天攻破百余项世界级数学难题</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里平头哥发布AI芯片真武V900，算力较M890提升至三倍</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c7d9edadc63c9abf5e536b8b6cc12fd1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">在2026云栖大会上，阿里平头哥正式发布新一代AI芯片真武V900，其算力达到上一代真武M890的三倍。该芯片支持构建单一集群规模扩展至50万卡，旨在为前沿AI模型的训练与推理提供大规模算力支撑。阿里集团CEO吴泳铭表示，自研M890 AI超节点已具备支撑2万亿参数大模型推理的能力，并于本季度在阿里云数据中心规模化上架。此外，阿里同步布局端侧AI生态，正式开源千问2.7B模型并推出移动端AI解决方案。通过从真武V900芯片、超大规模集群到云端基础设施及端侧模型的全栈布局，阿里旨在覆盖AI模型从训练、推理到终端部署的全链路算力需求，随着平头哥芯片产品线成熟，预计年出货量将显著增长。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">小米发布MiMo-V2.6大模型，Pro版以46分登顶开源模型榜单</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9eb6e706dc8948ecba4732a07ec24d4d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">9月22日，小米正式发布MiMo-V2.6大模型，包含Pro和Flash两个原生全模态版本。在Artificial Analysis综合智能指数中，Pro版本以46分位居开源模型首位，超越Kimi K3与Qwen3.8Max，但与Claude Fable5.1及GPT-6Astra等顶级闭源模型仍存差距。定价方面，V2.6延续了极高性价比，Flash与Pro版本缓存命中价格分别为0.02元与0.025元，官方称其性价比约为海外模型的60倍。同步上线的MiMo Desktop桌面客户端支持会员订阅及API Key配置，其中Pro版专属的UltraSpeed超高速模式可将推理速度提升至最高20倍，旨在满足强实时交互与低延迟场景需求。此次发布进一步拉低了高性能开源模型的应用门槛，对行业内同类产品构成显著竞争压力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">华为云码道全面升级：发布全球首个鸿蒙专属AI编码智能体</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8be91497157abcc04a7d5da3ff0d153e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">华为云CodeArts码道正式升级，推出全球首个鸿蒙专属AI编码智能体，旨在打通鸿蒙应用从想法到上架的全流程。此次升级包含三大核心能力：鸿蒙编码大模型、码道鸿蒙智能体及鸿蒙开发者实践中心。其中，鸿蒙编码大模型依托鸿蒙增强训练体系，在代码生成质量、编译通过率及Token消耗效率上实现优化。配套的鸿蒙编码智能体集成DevEco CLI等首创能力，覆盖编码、调试、构建全生命周期，将割裂的手动操作整合为自动化流程。此外，鸿蒙开发者实践中心提供云端实践环境与多场景实战案例，显著降低开发门槛。该方案通过提供全链路数字搭档，旨在提升鸿蒙生态开发者的作业效率，解决开发过程中的技术挑战。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">SpaceXAI发布Grok 4.7模型：推理速度翻倍且价格降至每百万Token输入2美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b2713b9bed5394a327bf18f3bba64c64.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">SpaceXAI于9月21日正式发布Grok 4.7模型，通过技术优化实现推理速度翻倍，同时将定价大幅下调。在成本控制方面，Grok 4.7的输入Token价格降至每百万个2美元，输出Token价格为每百万个6美元。官方强调，该模型在保持高性能的同时，将推理成本压缩至同类竞品的一半，显著提升了性价比门槛。此次更新旨在通过极致的成本效益比，为开发者和企业用户提供更具竞争力的LLM基础设施选择，进一步推动AI应用在高性能与低成本之间的平衡发展。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI成立数学与AI顾问组，神秘模型24天攻破百余项世界级数学难题</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f39d013c609928964b3655cf21265248.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI宣布成立由九位数学家组成的“数学与AI顾问组”，并披露其8月28日启动训练的神秘模型在24天内攻破了100多个数学领域开放问题，其中包括纳维-斯托克斯千年大奖难题。该顾问组设在普林斯顿高等研究院，成员包括Timothy Gowers、Martin Hairer及Edward Witten等三位菲尔兹奖得主，且独立于OpenAI运作，不领取报酬。顾问组将负责评估AI数学成果的重要性、提供学术标准建议，并指导OpenAI工具如何支持数学研究。针对该模型惊人的进展速度，OpenAI内部正探讨如何稳重地向学界披露成果，以应对此前数学界对AI解决开放问题基准可能带来的负面影响。此举旨在加强AI公司与数学界的交流，确保数学AI能力的开发与部署符合学术规范。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
